were of great significance for clinical application by clinicians. Our study inevitably has limitations. The data in our research are entirely from TCGA database and GEO datasets, implying that the clinical utility of our model needs more prospective realworld data to be verified. Furthermore, there was no experimental evidence that associated risk sore with immune activity. To summarize, we defined a prognostic model of 13 ferroptosis-related genes, and identified seven pairs of coexpressed ferroptosis-related genes and tumor-infiltrating immune cells. Our study provides insight into the underlying mechanism between ferroptosis and tumor-infiltrating immune cells in LUAD.
